  "content": "<h1><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pryKgL0g/image.png\"></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0yGtHQkM/BOTANIAJEI.png\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\"> </strong>这个简单的插件为 Botania 在 JEI 中添加了有用的信息：</h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yBSdGn8c/image.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"> 纯净雏菊配方标签页现在显示制作所需的秒数：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9k9Xf0l.png\" alt=\"纯净雏菊 JEI\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/V0B8yFBH/image.png\" width=\"26\" height=\"25\"> 魔泉配方标签页现在显示制作所需的魔力值：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g3ZeDUb.png\" alt=\"魔力注入 JEI\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ycJ7Fzn5/image.png\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"> 符文祭坛标签页也显示魔力值：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U1UeJjC.png\" alt=\"符文祭坛 JEI\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gZSCYHwC/image.png\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\"> 以及地脉聚合器标签页：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nb7PSif.png\" alt=\"地脉聚合器 JEI\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xq0kh5sq/image.png\"></strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cKSG97Y1/image.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\"></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixin-booter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt; MixinBooter</a></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt; Botania</a></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt; JEI</a></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NdSz7cqP/image.png\" width=\"344\" height=\"38\"></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt; Botania</a></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt; JEI</a></h3>",
